WEBVTT

00:02.003 --> 00:05.636
One household, four currencies, one total in euros

00:05.636 --> 00:09.231
Each account keeps its own currency

00:09.231 --> 00:18.636
Send €200 from Salary to the Bangkok account

00:18.636 --> 00:26.812
Leave the baht empty to convert at today's rate

00:26.812 --> 00:31.195
Both balances move, each in its own currency

00:31.195 --> 00:49.396
Add a dinner in baht with one key: T

00:49.396 --> 00:53.297
Grace adds groceries on her phone, and it appears live

00:53.297 --> 00:58.693
Budgets this month: Groceries over, Travel well under

00:58.693 --> 01:01.994
Every view totals in the household's currency

01:01.994 --> 01:04.857
Free to host yourself, or use the cloud
